          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "email was borrowed from English e-mail, short for electronic mail; mail goes back through Middle English male to Anglo-Norman male (EtymDB), usually explained as a word for a bag."
            }
          ]
